 JSON in, JSON out. Routes are listed in `README.md`.

+## Authentication and authorization
+
+Send `Authorization: Bearer <key>` with every request. Configure keys in
+`apiKeys` in the data file; seed keys are examples and should be replaced.
+Migrated files have no keys until configured. Viewers can use GET routes except
+`/audit`. Cooks can also cook recipes, record waste, log temperatures and
+enter stock-take counts. Managers can use every route. Missing or unknown keys
+return `unauthorized` (401); insufficient permission returns `forbidden` (403).
+
+## Routes
+
+All routes are listed in the README. `GET /audit` is manager-only and returns
+successful data-changing requests newest first, with time, key name, method,
+path and status.
+
 ## Errors

 Errors have a status from `src/errors.js` and the body
