+## API access and audit
+
+- Schema 3 adds `apiKeys` (key, name and role) and `audit` arrays. Migrated
+  files start with empty arrays; configure keys before using the API.
+- Successful API writes append an audit record with an ISO time, key name,
+  method, path and response status. Keys themselves are never in the audit.
